## Acceptance boundary

The public Java constructor's scheduler-registration behavior now has a Rust
mapping. Rust `new`/`Default` remains an unscheduled convenience. Broad P18-V01
API/settings/input/error/control-flow and reverse-export reconciliation remains
PARTIAL. Native Windows runtime and current-revision remote CI remain open. No
plan was edited, no push or remote CI was run, and the four user-owned Phase 19
paths remain untouched and unstaged.
